    <!-- Growth OS's "Reach" mark: the real Fillbook bar mark, rescaled
         uniformly at the same relative proportions, with two asymmetric
         broadcast arcs above and left of the tallest bar: Fillbook
         reaching and growing an audience. Same brand family as
         Fillbook's icon (same bars, same cyan/navy palette), a distinct
         silhouette from it. The two arcs deliberately differ in length
         and weight (not nested identical quarter-circles) so the mark
         doesn't read as a signal-strength/Wi-Fi glyph, and both are
         sized and placed to stay inside the guaranteed-visible safe
         zone verified on-device, not just the full adaptive-icon
         canvas. -->
